# Route: guide 12 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 33 to
# 36, 29 quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Hillsbrad Foothills, Arathi Highlands, Dustwallow Marsh): Southshore
# -> Western Strand -> Southshore -> Western Strand -> Southshore -> Tarren
# Mill -> Darrow Hill -> Southshore -> Circle of West Binding -> Thandol Span
# -> Theramore Isle -> Witch Hill -> Theramore Isle -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 6607 Nat Pagle,
# Angler Extreme; 6624 Triage.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In the Name of the Light (1053), Tiara of the Deep (2846).

